{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664130/extras/d6f53a929b16770c315c4538d1f0ae1f.poster.avif?t=1624863902\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664130/extras/d6f53a929b16770c315c4538d1f0ae1f.gif?t=1624863902\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><i><strong>Mighty Chameleon Brothers</strong></i> is a short indie game created by Gallagher Laird &amp; Kevin McConnell. It was inspired by arcade games of the 80's and 90's. Gameplay consists of clearing enemy insects from a stage as quickly and efficiently as possible. The player controls a lovable chameleon (Lash) with the ability to capture and defeat multiple enemies with his lengthy tongue. <i><strong>Mighty Chameleon Brothers</strong></i> will remind you of old-school arcade classics, with bright and colorful visuals and fun cartoon characters! You'll love the simple yet addictive game play!<br><br>A lot of work and passion went into this project. <i>Please note that the game is quite short</i>. We weren't able to include all of the things we had planned, but we still hope you enjoy it!<br><br>Character design, graphic design, game design, sprite animation - <strong>Gallagher Laird</strong><br>Programming and game design - <strong>Kevin McConnell</strong><br>Music and sound effects - <strong>Emma Kramer-Rodger</strong><br>Additional background artwork - <strong>Lance Buan</strong><br><br><strong><u>GAME CONTROLS:</u></strong><br><br>Start Game - Z, X, 5, Enter<br>Arrow Keys - Move Character, Aim Tongue<br>Jump - Z, Alt<br>Shoot Tongue - X, Ctrl<br>Reset Current Stage - Select, A<br>Reset Game - 6<br>Full Screen - T, F<br>Quit Game - Q","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1664130?t=1624863902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1624863902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664130/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1624863902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664130/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1624863902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664130/extras/d6f53a929b16770c315c4538d1f0ae1f.poster.avif?t=1624863902\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1664130/extras/d6f53a929b16770c315c4538d1f0ae1f.gif?t=1624863902\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><br><i><strong>Mighty Chameleon Brothers</strong></i> is a short indie game created by Gallagher Laird &amp; Kevin McConnell. It was inspired by arcade games of the 80's and 90's. Gameplay consists of clearing enemy insects from a stage as quickly and efficiently as possible. The player controls a lovable chameleon (Lash) with the ability to capture and defeat multiple enemies with his lengthy tongue. <i><strong>Mighty Chameleon Brothers</strong></i> will remind you of old-school arcade classics, with bright and colorful visuals and fun cartoon characters! You'll love the simple yet addictive game play!<br><br>A lot of work and passion went into this project. <i>Please note that the game is quite short</i>. We weren't able to include all of the things we had planned, but we still hope you enjoy it!<br><br>Character design, graphic design, game design, sprite animation - <strong>Gallagher Laird</strong><br>Programming and game design - <strong>Kevin McConnell</strong><br>Music and sound effects - <strong>Emma Kramer-Rodger</strong><br>Additional background artwork - <strong>Lance Buan</strong>